!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/validate/valid/an-extern-of-a-subtype-selects-a-variant-whose-target-is-concrete-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/validate-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.9"
  description: """
    A concrete variant admits its subtypes as an abstract one does. At `( parcel_v1 | parcel_v2 )`, two plain
    records, `bulky_v1` and `bulky_v2` reach the `bulky` of each foreign schema, each IS-A the `parcel` of its own
    and of no other, so each selects its schema's variant and is read against its own `bulky`.
    """
  valid: _
}
